WEBVTT

00:13:57.249 --> 00:14:00.000
(Most animals would
if they lost half that much.)

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:04.590
I'll drink 5 to 7 gallons
of water a day.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:08.976
But go without for more than a month.

00:14:09.714 --> 00:14:11.406
I'm powerful.

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:15.430
Able to pack up to 400 lbs. of cargo.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.000
Outrun a horse --

00:14:19.809 --> 00:14:21.785
And cover 26 miles on a good day.

00:14:24.589 --> 00:14:25.976
Camelot.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:28.048
Jackie O. once said
that traveling by camel

00:14:28.072 --> 00:14:31.072
made riding an elephant seem
like taking a jet plane.